OL,3,ATrump announces deal for Russian diesel
OL,4,Aas Zelensky calls it a gift to Putin
OL,5,
OL,6,FTrump said Putin had agreed to release
OL,7,F300,000 tonnes of diesel immediately
OL,8,F"to the American and global
OL,9,Fmarketplace" followed by 500,000 tonnes
OL,10,Fin November and another million after
OL,11,Fthat.
OL,13,FIt is understood the US Treasury is
OL,14,Fsuspending sanctions on Russian diesel
OL,15,Fexports until 7 April as part of the
OL,16,Fdeal, but other assets like those in
OL,17,FAmerican banks are still frozen.
OL,23,APub: 09-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG2/2
